{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f27a0d06db7dbed","type":"tool_result","content":"8:## Unreleased\n9-\n10-- feat: route the GitHub REST client and the GH-token preflight through `bborbe/http`'s rate-limit retry round tripper (`github.com/bborbe/http` v1.28.1), so a 403/429 from `api.github.com` is retried after the server-requested wait instead of ending the work item; the per-wait `MaxWait` bound is one second so the total sleep budget across the default five attempts (5 × 1s) stays inside both client timeouts, and a longer server-requested wait is deferred so the caller sees the real rate-limit response rather than a context-deadline error\n11-\n12-## v0.8.7\n13-\n14-- chore: remove orphaned section comments left in `.trivyignore` by the stale-ignore sweep\n15-\n16-## v0.8.6\n17-\n18-- chore: remove 10 stale vulnerability ignores (withdrawn advisory, module absent from go.mod, or version outside the affected range)\n19-\n20-## v0.8.5","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aea865d8-e16a-460b-ba00-5a0529fd626c","uuid":"98174cd5-b9dd-4248-a7fa-993a16255223","timestamp":"2026-11-27T14:31:12.360Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"8:## Unreleased\n9-\n10-- feat: route the GitHub REST client and the GH-token preflight through `bborbe/http`'s rate-limit retry round tripper (`github.com/bborbe/http` v1.28.1), so a 403/429 from `api.github.com` is retried after the server-requested wait instead of ending the work item; the per-wait `MaxWait` bound is one second so the total sleep budget across the default five attempts (5 × 1s) stays inside both client timeouts, and a longer server-requested wait is deferred so the caller sees the real rate-limit response rather than a context-deadline error\n11-\n12-## v0.8.7\n13-\n14-- chore: remove orphaned section comments left in `.trivyignore` by the stale-ignore sweep\n15-\n16-## v0.8.6\n17-\n18-- chore: remove 10 stale vulnerability ignores (withdrawn advisory, modul